                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A great throwback to old school brawlers. Hero Boy not only has some great gameplay, but has levels and enemies right out of a child's imagination, all while a real life apocalypse threatens said child's life.\n\nGameplay can get a bit difficult, but it's fun to mix and match the special abilities you get to see what can handle each type of enemy you come across. Some genuinely spooky moments in the game as well. \n\nPros:\n- Great story with a unique art style\n- Fighting mechanics are solid, unique abilities add more flavor and strategy\n\nSome cons:\n- Some of the levels can feel a bit repetitive as you fight room after room of enemies.\n- Elephant boss is painful\n",
